    "created_at": "2026-02-06T22:52:15.903Z",
    "cooked": "<p>Oops, I assumed the screenshots were taken on meta but I didn’t even think of checking it.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><s>Small but weird behavior. On the regular theme, when we release the mouse button on <span class=\"d-wrap\" data-id=\"bars\" data-wrap=\"icon\"></span>, it instantly triggers the show or close sidebar’s animation.</s></p>\n<p><s>On the new theme, when we release the mouse button on <span class=\"d-wrap\" data-id=\"bars\" data-wrap=\"icon\"></span> when the sidebar is closed, there’s a split second of waiting before the sliding animation is triggered. Doesn’t happen if we click the icon when the sidebar is visible.</s></p>\n<p>I’m probably hallucinating <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitt…</p>",
